Subject: [PATCH 31/34] dt-bindings: watchdog: qcom-wdt: Document MSM8953 APSS watchdog


The MSM8953 APSS watchdog uses the KPSS register layout. Allow its
SoC-specific compatible with the existing qcom,kpss-wdt fallback.

Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-6.2-astra
